  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "くろいかげの　かたまりを　なげつけて\nこうげきする。　あいての　とくぼうを\nさげることが　ある。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "까만 그림자의 덩어리를 내던져서\n공격한다. 상대의 특수방어를\n떨어뜨릴 때가 있다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "投擲一團黑影進行攻擊。\n有時會降低對手的特防。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Projette une grande ombre sur l’ennemi.\nPeut aussi faire baisser sa Défense Spéciale.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Bewirft das Ziel mit einem gruseligen Ball und senkt\neventuell dessen Spezial-Verteidigung.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Lanza una bola oscura que puede bajar la Defensa\nEspecial del objetivo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Lancia sul bersaglio una sfera nera.\nPuò anche ridurne la Difesa Speciale.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user hurls a shadowy blob at the target.\nThis may also lower the target’s Sp. Def stat.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "黒い影の　塊を　投げつけて\n攻撃する。　相手の　特防を\nさげることが　ある。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "投掷一团黑影进行攻击。\n有时会降低对手的特防。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Lanza una bola oscura que puede bajar la Defensa\nEspecial del objetivo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
